11:T99d,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I apply for more than one opportunity?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Usually yes, unless a programme's official rules restrict parallel applications. Keep a tracker for deadlines, references and programme-specific documents."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does AspireCompass accept applications?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. AspireCompass helps you discover and compare opportunities. Applications must be submitted on the official programme or institution website."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is studying in Germany free for every international student?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Tuition and fees depend on the state, institution and programme, and living costs still apply. Confirm the current fee schedule for the exact course."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where do I apply for DAAD EPOS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Applications are normally submitted to the selected eligible postgraduate course according to its instructions, not through one universal DAAD application. Check the current DAAD listing and course deadline."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does AspireCompass submit applications for students?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. AspireCompass is an independent research and guidance website. Apply only through the programme, university, government or employer portal linked as the official source."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can a deadline or eligibility rule change after this page is updated?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Programme owners can revise dates, benefits and rules. Reopen the official call before you act, check the intake year and save a copy of the instructions used for your application."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is studying in Germany completely free for international students?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not always. Tuition policy varies by institution and programme, and students still need to plan semester contributions, insurance, housing, food, travel and other costs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does every DAAD scholarship require work experience?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Requirements differ by programme. DAAD EPOS generally targets development-related postgraduate courses and relevant professional experience, but other awards use different rules."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Explore opportunities by country and region\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/countries/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Scholarships in Germany for international students\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/countries/germany/\"}]}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Scholarships in Germany for international students\",\"description\":\"Research Germany scholarships for 2027, DAAD routes, university admission, programme language, living costs and application steps.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/programme-research-editorial.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-31\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-09-21\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/countries/germany/\"}"}}],["$","script","2"