16:["$","p","DAAD's database is the best starting point for its current programmes. EPOS is aimed at applicants from eligible countries and generally expects relevant professional experience.",{"children":"DAAD's database is the best starting point for its current programmes. EPOS is aimed at applicants from eligible countries and generally expects relevant professional experience."}]
17:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Check the exact programme language",{"children":"Check the exact programme language"}],["$","li","Use the official DAAD scholarship database",{"children":"Use the official DAAD scholarship database"}],["$","li","Confirm APS or document-verification rules where relevant",{"children":"Confirm APS or document-verification rules where relevant"}],["$","li","Compare city-level living costs",{"children":"Compare city-level living costs"}],["$","li","Review work-experience requirements carefully",{"children":"Review work-experience requirements carefully"}]]}]
18:["$","section","How AspireCompass verifies listings",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How AspireCompass verifies listings"}],[["$","p","We summarise eligibility, funding and timing from the programme owner whenever an official page is available. Every listing shows the source and the date it was last checked.",{"children":"We summarise eligibility, funding and timing from the programme owner whenever an official page is available. Every listing shows the source and the date it was last checked."}],["$","p","Scholarship and recruitment details can change without notice. Always read the official call, confirm the deadline in your time zone and apply through the programme owner's portal. AspireCompass does not award scholarships or charge an application fee.",{"children":"Scholarship and recruitment details can change without notice. Always read the official call, confirm the deadline in your time zone and apply through the programme owner's portal. AspireCompass does not award scholarships or charge an application fee."}]],"$undefined"]}]
19:["$","section","How to research a German programme",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How to research a German programme"}],[["$","p","Check the university's programme page for language, subject prerequisites, application route and semester dates. Some applications go directly to the university, while others use uni-assist or another stated process. Follow the exact programme instructions.",{"children":"Check the university's programme page for language, subject prerequisites, application route and semester dates. Some applications go directly to the university, while others use uni-assist or another stated process. Follow the exact programme instructions."}],["$","p","For DAAD EPOS, applicants normally apply to an eligible postgraduate course and must meet course-specific deadlines. The programme is aimed at applicants from eligible developing and newly industrialised countries and generally expects at least two years of relevant professional experience.",{"children":"For DAAD EPOS, applicants normally apply to an eligible postgraduate course and must meet course-specific deadlines. The programme is aimed at applicants from eligible developing and newly industrialised countries and generally expects at least two years of relevant professional experience."}]],"$undefined"]}]
1a:["$","section","Plan documents and visa evidence",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Plan documents and visa evidence"}],[["$","p","Allow time for certified copies, translations and any country-specific academic verification. A scholarship decision does not remove the need to meet university admission and German immigration requirements.",{"children":"Allow time for certified copies, translations and any country-specific academic verification. A scholarship decision does not remove the need to meet university admission and German immigration requirements."}]],"$undefined"]}]
1b:["$","section","Quick answer: funding and admission are separate checks",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Quick answer: funding and admission are separate checks"}],[["$","p","Germany combines DAAD and foundation scholarships with university or research-based funding. Some public programmes have low or no tuition, but that does not remove semester contributions, insurance, living expenses or financial-proof requirements.",{"children":"Germany combines DAAD and foundation scholarships with university or research-based funding. Some public programmes have low or no tuition, but that does not remove semester contributions, insurance, living expenses or financial-proof requirements."}],["$","p","DAAD EPOS is course-specific and normally expects relevant professional experience. Other DAAD database entries can follow different nationality, subject, degree and application routes.",{"children":"DAAD EPOS is course-specific and normally expects relevant professional experience. Other DAAD database entries can follow different nationality, subject, degree and application routes."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Search the exact eligible course",{"children":"Search the exact eligible course"}],["$","li","Check scholarship and admission deadlines",{"children":"Check scholarship and admission deadlines"}],["$","li","Confirm programme language",{"children":"Confirm programme language"}],["$","li","Calculate semester and living costs",{"children":"Calculate semester and living costs"}],["$","li","Follow the stated application portal",{"children":"Follow the stated application portal"}]]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","Build a Germany application sequence",{"id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a Germany application sequence"}],[["$","p","First confirm that your previous degree meets the programme's academic prerequisites. Next identify whether admission uses the university, uni-assist or another route. Then check whether the scholarship application is combined or separate.",{"children":"First confirm that your previous degree meets the programme's academic prerequisites. Next identify whether admission uses the university, uni-assist or another route. Then check whether the scholarship application is combined or separate."}],["$","p","For research degrees, read the department and supervisor process before sending a proposal. Use official DAAD and university pages for the current intake rather than copying an older checklist.",{"children":"For research degrees, read the department and supervisor process before sending a proposal. Use official DAAD and university pages for the current intake rather than copying an older checklist."}]],"$undefined"]}]
